        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-20T00:07:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "enums would work, but after some consideration, I think the explicit #defines here provide better documentation. The shorter lists (e.g. status_mode) aren\u0027t too bad, but for ilim visually it would be hard to know if 3A is 13 without counting,",
      "parentUuid": "00657634_ad72cac4",
      "range": {
