        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-20T00:07:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did consider this case and I was going to control these options with additional flags in ppc_config_t struct. However, the config option for DETECT_VBUS_PPC already existed it follows the model for all the different VBUS detect options, and I felt it would be non-optimal to have 2 PPC options control by flags and 1 of them controlled by config options.",
      "parentUuid": "037e79ba_17dbb518",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3341,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3342,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "aaac1aa7da7cb1ccceee749ede018551a61165a0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
